{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/342320-midnight-express-podcast","id":342320,"title":"Midnight Express Podcast","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-16T15:09:53-08:00","id":342320,"title":"Midnight Express Podcast","content":"<span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Hi everyone,<br /> <br /> Midnight Express will be undergoing a few changes in the new year. I'll be reworking the music choices, leaning a little on the train theme that gives the podcast its' name, and have started to give categories to the episodes.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">Thus far we have:</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><b>Game Line Spotlights</b> - we cover a full game line (or in the case of Hunters) a cohesive set of books</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><b>Companion Readers</b> - these will accompany each Game Line Spotlight and be released soon after. The hosts will review one title from the game line in-depth.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\"><b>Regular Episodes</b> - these will continue to cover gaming news, advice, and broader topic discussion.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">I already have a bonus episode lined up as a Christmas release (it will actually go out this Friday rather than Boxing Day), and then I have two other episodes lined up for recording over the next three weeks.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">It would appear that 2015 will be about solidifying the identity of the podcast and putting into practice what we have learned thus far. I have one other project for next year that I am trying desperately to find time for, so we'll see if this comes to fruition. It's Changeling-related - that's all I'll say for now. <br /> <br /> If you haven't already listened to an episode (or two), you can find the podcast at: </span></span>http://midnightexpress.podbean.com/<br /> <br /> Adrian BK<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-24T16:09:55-08:00","id":349378,"title":"","content":"Just a quick bump, as any feedback is most welcome.<br /> <br /> And Merry Christmas.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://t0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTAO8runv-CR5dodCXgw_8wdJype5yunYCODWdZiBAwUP5WFVv8\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://ksr-ugc.imgix.net/assets/003/593/392/92a29c2836b988505781770a32720148_original.png?v=1428699067&amp;w=700&amp;h=&amp;fit=max&amp;auto=format&amp;lossless=true&amp;s=69ffdde357a0cdd88ee89934622443f9\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img692/7017/hh2support.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img703/6636/6kvo.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1721-beckett","name":"Beckett","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1721_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1077"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-07T11:18:46-08:00","id":362